OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens when a whale washes
OL,4,Aup on a beach?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA whale and a shark washed up on the
OL,7,Fsame beach within days of each other on
OL,8,Fthe Northumberland coast, with images
OL,9,Fshared on social media prompting
OL,10,Fquestions about what happens next. What
OL,11,Fshould you do if you encounter
OL,12,Fsomething similar?
OL,14,FA pilot whale was recovered from
OL,15,FDruridge Bay near Amble on Friday, days
OL,16,Fafter it washed up on a beach as the
OL,17,Flargest of six to have died when a pod
OL,18,Fwas seen in distress off the coast in
OL,19,FSeptember.
OL,21,FA week earlier, a porbeagle shark was
OL,22,Falso recovered.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
