OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens when a whale washes
OL,4,Aup on a beach?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficial government advice is to report
OL,7,Fsightings immediately to British Divers
OL,8,FMarine Life Rescue (BDMLR) if it the
OL,9,Fanimal is alive or the Cetacean
OL,10,FStrandings Investigation Programme
OL,11,F(CSIP) if dead.
